    "description": "What you'll learn:\n1/ How to recognize and pre-empt failure patterns. Learn from catastrophic agent deployments through the lens of One-way vs Two-way door decisions\n\n2/ How you tackle this being the Agent Owner for your org. Post-mortems trace every major AI failure to one question: who defined what the agent was allowed to do?\n\n3/ Live demo: Build the Agent Owner spec. We vibe-code an Agent Owner spec in Claude Code. Watch what it can do, what it pre-empts and what failure looks like.\n\nEnroll in our one day workshop 'AI PM Certification: From Specs & Evals to Leadership Sign-off' - https://maven.com/level-up-with-ai/ai-pm-survival-frameworks-2026-certification\n\n---------\nAbout Jason Yoong\nOver 15+ years, I’ve run $1B+ organizations in eCommerce, advertising, media, and marketplaces — led 40+ person teams, owned P&L, managed $400M+ marketing budgets, and won multiple awards for driving measurable growth and ROI. \n\nOperating leader at Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG). Then, raised $8M seed as the founding team of a venture-backed software startup and built the go-to-market motion from zero to traction. \n\nToday, I am the Co-Founder & COO of Level Up, a career success platform built to help ambitious professionals make career breakthroughs and become AI+ to win in the AI age. The platform spans a weekly newsletter, video podcast, paid membership community, leadership development courses, and custom AI GPTs for 24/7 executive coaching. \n\nI also serve on the Harvard Business Review (HBR) advisory council and as a mentor at Techstars.\n\nJason's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\nLevel Up Newsletter: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/\n\n---------\nAbout Gayathri Keerthana (GK)\nAI and Product Consultant | ex-Amazon Product Leader | ESADE MBA\n\nMost people stick to one thing. At 31, I'm managing to experiment with three: AI consulting, co-founding an AI-native startup, and building an e-commerce brand in the UK.\n\nThis is possible because of a rather uncommon mix of experiences I managed to pack in just over a decade:\n\n• Senior Product Manager in a $7.2B business unit at Amazon — leading ML and econometric models that actually moved the needle on delivery experience\n\n• Ops Management at an Amazon robotics site, leading a team of 300+, producing 250K+ shipments / night\n\n• MBA from ESADE (ranked #7 by FT): Social Impact Scholarship, VP of Tech & Media club\n\n• Led marketing at B2B SaaS unicorns (Typeform, Chargebee, Zoho): inbound, virality, demand gen and the whole shebang.\n\n• Founded a non-profit in rural India at 19, for 5+ years, and recognised with state-level awards.\n\nI also help exceptional tech leaders get the UK Global Talent Visa. \n\nI believe in a human-in-the-loop approach to leveraging AI and prefer using it as a problem solver than a decision maker.\n\nGK's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/gayathri-keerthana/\n\nGK's Consulting: https://flywheelbygk.com/",
