    "description": "What you'll learn:\n1/ Define \"good\" before you write code. Evals are replacing prds. Learn the framework that tests judgement before launch.\n\n2/ Write behavior specs, not feature specs. AI doesn't execute instructions - it interprets them. Learn to encode judgment so your model does what you actually mean\n\n3/ Set your autonomy dial (live demo of real product). Make decisions to govern judgement - what AI controls and what humans control, using an autonomy map.\n\nWhy this topic matters: Al features can look \"done\" and still fail users in production. AI-Native PMs fix this. They define success criteria, encode judgment into behavior specs, and decide autonomy levels for AI - before incidents happen in production. This talk gives PMs 3 battle-tested frameworks, the same principles used in industrial eval infrastructures that serve 100M+ users. (includes real product live demo)\n\nOne day workshop on 'Claude Cowork Certification: For Non-Technical Professionals & Business Owners' — https://maven.com/level-up-leadership-team/claude-cowork-certification\n\n---------\nAbout Jason Yoong\nOver 15+ years, I’ve run $1B+ organizations in eCommerce, advertising, media, and marketplaces — led 40+ person teams, owned P&L, managed $400M+ marketing budgets, and won multiple awards for driving measurable growth and ROI. \n\nOperating leader at Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG). Then, raised $8M seed as the founding team of a venture-backed software startup and built the go-to-market motion from zero to traction. \n\nToday, I am the Co-Founder & COO of Level Up, a career success platform built to help ambitious professionals make career breakthroughs and become AI+ to win in the AI age. The platform spans a weekly newsletter, video podcast, paid membership community, leadership development courses, and custom AI GPTs for 24/7 executive coaching. \n\nI also serve on the Harvard Business Review (HBR) advisory council and as a mentor at First Round Capital and Techstars.\n\nJason's LinkedIn: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/\n\nLevel Up Newsletter: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\n---------\nAbout Shankha Dey\nCurrently Sr. Director PM at Salesforce Data+AI leading Agentic Enterprise Search. Built the evaluation and data labeling infrastructure for Microsoft Turing (GPT-2 equivalent model) — powers 100M+ users in Copilot. Led AI platform across Bing, Cortana (now Copilot), Microsoft Search & Assistant.\n\n15+ years shipping AI at planet scale across consumer and enterprise. MS Computer Science, Columbia University. Founded a visual search startup 5 years before Google Lens.\n\nShankha's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/shankhasdey/",
    "published": "2026-04-24T13:00:43.000Z"
