    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yHhLX8OzWk8",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "orange",
    "description": "Why this topic matters: Early careers are shaped by momentum. Learn the big (and small) behaviors that compound — because hard work and delivering good results is not enough to drive rapid promotion.\n\nWhat you'll learn:\n1/ Specific actions we did that worked\n2/ What we saw others do well\n3/ What we (as execs) look for in rising stars\n4/ Audience Q&A\n\nContent is designed for early to mid career professionals (ICs and new managers with under 15 years experience) but the principles are applicable to anyone.\n\nEnroll in Jason's course (rated 4.9/5) \"Get Promoted Faster: For ICs & Managers\" - https://maven.com/ethan-evans/early-career-promotion-fast-track\n\n---------\nAbout Jason Yoong\nOver the past 15+ years, I’ve run $1B+ organizations in eCommerce, advertising, media, and marketplaces — led 40+ person teams, owned P&L, and managed $400M+ marketing budgets that delivered measurable growth and ROI.\n\nAt Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG), I operated at global scale. Later, as a founding team member of a venture-backed software startup, I helped raise $8M in seed funding and built the go-to-market motion from zero to traction.\n\nToday, I am the Cofounder & COO of Level Up, a career acceleration platform with 250,000+ followers. Alongside Ethan Evans (retired Amazon VP), we combine executive coaching, leadership courses, weekly newsletter, an engaged community, and custom AI GPT tools to help ambitious professionals grow faster, avoid mistakes, and make better career moves.\n\nI also serve on the Harvard Business Review (HBR) advisory council and as a mentor at First Round Capital and Techstars.\n\nJason's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\nLevel Up Newsletter: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/\n\n---------\nAbout Dina Keilany\nVP of Sales at Oracle & Board Member at National Academy of Sports Medicine.\n\nDrove 200-646% YOY revenue growth across US/Canada using AI/innovative sales tooling at scale. Wins span 3 product lines in new vertical with limited resources. \n\n“We are the music makers, we are the dreamers of dreams.”\n\nDina's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/dinakeilany/",
