    "format": "Conversation",
    "sourceLabel": "Auto-discovered",
    "sourceNote": "Auto-discovered from Ethan’s public YouTube channel with YouTube Data API; review before publishing.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-BAdkBGjOIlccGLZ3jbLiA",
    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k3ojRgSKqN8",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "green",
    "description": "Join now - Executive Presence: How to communicate with authority and get noticed at the highest levels - https://ethanevans.webflow.io/wb-ep-cu#join\n\nWhat you'll learn:\n1/ How to make gravitas visible beyond simply speaking and being loud\n\n2/ How to build your reputation presence (define and control it)\n\n3/ Audience Q&A\n\nWhy this topic matters: An academic definition of Executive Presence is 60% Gravitas, 30% Communication, and 10% Appearance. Functionally, strong Executive Presence is being sought, asked, seen, considered, and followed. You will learn how to make your gravitas visible without simply speaking and being loud.\n\nIf you want to learn how to more confidently command high-stakes rooms, win C-suite alignment, and finesse your executive communications — enroll in our course Stronger Executive Presence: Be Visible, Gain Influence, & Drive Your Career — https://maven.com/ethan-evans/executive-presence-influence\n\nEach cohort is limited to 50 seats. \n\n---------\nAbout Ethan Evans:\nIn Ethan's 15+ years at Amazon, he led global teams of 800+ and invented well-known businesses and products such as Prime Video, Amazon Video, Amazon Appstore, Merch by Amazon, Prime Gaming (formerly Twitch Prime), and Twitch Commerce. \n\n-- 70+ patents. \n-- Reviewed 10,000+ resumes, conducted 2,500+ interviews, and 1,000+ hires. \n-- Was an Amazon Bar Raiser and Bar Raiser Core Leader, responsible for training and maintaining Amazon's group of interview outcome facilitators. \n-- Helped advocate for and draft the Amazon Leadership Principle (LP) “Ownership” — the words, “They never say ‘that’s not my job.’” are Ethan's. \n\nEthan's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/\n\nLevel Up Newsletter: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/\n\nEthan's leadership development courses https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
