    "description": "Maven is offering 20% off our following two courses, expiores June 22nd (Sunday):\n\nBreakthrough to Executive is for leaders wanting to grow to Principal, Staff, Director, or VP: https://maven.com/ethan-evans/break-through-to-executive\n\nGet Promoted Faster is for ICs and new managers under 10 years experience who want rapid career growth: https://maven.com/ethan-evans/early-career-promotion-fast-track\n\nIn this 50min Maven Lightning Lesson, Ethan answers 3 pre-submitted community member questions and then live audience questions. EthanGPT answers first and then Ethan builds on top of. \n\nGet instant access to Ethan Evans AI (EthanGPT) and the getting started document to maximize your usage: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/announcing-ethan-evans-ai\n\nWhy this topic matters: \nMany people think \"If I do a great job, I will eventually get promoted.\" That is wrong and will cost you years of delayed career growth. Instead, you must acknowledge that promotions are a combination of delivering results, reliability, trustworthiness, relationships, and business needs.\n\n---------\nAbout Ethan Evans\n​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​Ethan retired from Amazon as a Vice President after 15 years where he led global teams of 800+ and invented well-known businesses and products such as Prime Video, Amazon Video, Amazon Appstore, Merch by Amazon, Prime Gaming (formerly Twitch Prime), and Twitch Commerce.\n\n​​​​​​​​​​​​-- 70+ patents.\n\n​​​​​​​​​​​​-- Reviewed 10,000+ resumes, conducted 2,500+ interviews, and 1,000+ hires.\n\n​​​​​​​​​​​​-- Was an Amazon Bar Raiser and Bar Raiser Core Leader, responsible for training and maintaining Amazon's group of interview outcome facilitators.\n\n​​​​​​​​​​​​-- Helped advocate for and draft the Amazon Leadership Principle (LP) “Ownership” — the words, “They never say ‘that’s not my job.’” are Ethan's (read the story).\n\n​​​​​Ethan has promoted 8 reports from Senior Manager (Amazon L7) to Director (Amazon L8), contributed to 25+ Director promotions, hired 10+ Directors internally and externally, drove the promotion of 3 engineers to Principal, and of his former reports 2 are current Amazon VPs (L10) and 5 are C-Suite outside of Amazon.\n\n​​​​​Ethan retired from Amazon as a Vice President in September 2020 to focus on paying forward his good fortune to others.\n\n​​​​​Prior to Amazon, Ethan spent 12 years at 3 startups.\n\nEthan's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/\n\nEthan's free newsletter Level Up: Grow fast, make optimal career moves, avoid mistakes and setbacks, and achieve your financial goals - https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/",
