    "description": "When the 4 factors are addressed, the risk of manager failure drops from 48% to just 5%. For each reason, Jason Yoong (Level Up; ex-Amazon) & Marsden Kline (MGMT Accelerator; ex-Goldman Sachs; ex-Google) cover the Manager action and the IC (direct report) action.\n\nTopics covered:\n1/ Lack of self-awareness — We all have blind spots! You must solicit and internalize feedback.\n\n2/ Lack of two-way empathy — You must help your team understand how to work with you and why it is a win / win to collaborate.\n\n3/ Unproductive relationships with employees — Invest in your team and work hard for their success and growth.\n\n4/ Absence of goal alignment — When scrambling to adapt to changing priorities, it is necessary to also continually re-adapt the employee focus.\n\n5/ (new) AI misalignment — 91% of managers encourage their teams to use AI, but only 15% of when use it themselves. \n\nFeatured course links:\n\n✅ Stuck at Senior Manager - How to Break Through to Executive course: https://maven.com/ethan-evans/break-through-to-executive\n\n✅ MGMT Accelerator: AI-Enhanced Leadership course: https://maven.com/dave-kline/mgmt-accelerator\n-----\nAbout Jason Yoong (COO of Level Up  & ex-Amazon)\n\nJason has run multiple $1B+ businesses across eCommerce, marketplaces, advertising, and media. He's led 40+ person organizations, owned department P&L, managed $400M+ marketing budgets for Fortune 100 entertainment (movies and TV) and consumer electronics clients, and served as an Advisory Board Member.\n\nAfter leading and building at publicly traded companies Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG), Jason joined the founding team of a venture-backed software startup and raised $8M seed.\n\nJason is now building Level Up: Your source for executive insights, high performance habits, and specific career growth actions with Ethan Evans (retired Amazon Vice President). He also serves on the Harvard Business Review advisory council and as a mentor at First Round Capital and Techstars.\n\nConnect with Jason on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\nLevel Up Newsletter: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/\n\nStuck at Senior Manager - How to Break Through to Executive course: https://maven.com/ethan-evans/break-through-to-executive\n\n-----\nAbout Marsden Kline (Co-founder MGMT Accelerator; ex-Goldman Sachs & Google)\nMarsden co-founded the MGMT Accelerator with Dave. After decades of daydreaming about what owning their own company would look like, the answer was teaching something we naturally enjoy. Marsden studied engineering at UVa but always volunteered to present (instead of code). Her love for people and problem-solving has led to a range of experiences: from Goldman Sachs to sales at Google to real estate at Compass. The common thread? A commitment to understanding the people at the table to more efficiently solve for yes.\n\nConnect with Marsden on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/marsdenkline/\n\nMGMT Playbook Newsletter: https://mgmt.beehiiv.com/\n\nMGMT Accelerator: AI-Enhanced Leadership course: https://maven.com/dave-kline/mgmt-accelerator",
