    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "coral",
    "description": "In this excerpt from a live stream, Ethan Evans shares expert insights on how to improve your interview skills by treating the process like a sport. He explains why preparation and practice are key, how to anticipate tough questions, and the best way to answer challenging interview questions—like why you didn’t finish college—without getting stuck.\n\nTimestamps & Key Takeaways:\n\n• 00:00:00 – Introduction: Why interviewing is like a sport\n• 00:00:15 –• 00:01:00 – The interviewer has a major advantage—they interview every day, while you do it every few years\n• 00:01:28 – Why quick thinkers do best in interviews (and how to prepare if that’s not you)\n• 00:02:24 – How to anticipate tough questions before your interview\n• 00:03:40 – Why some questions require immediate responses (like “Why didn’t you finish college?”)\n• 00:04:38 – How long is too long to pause before answering? (Hint: Silence makes interviewers uncomfortable)\n• 00:05:22 – The importance of honesty—but without oversharing\n• 00:06:00 – How to explain dropping out of college without making yourself look bad\n• 00:07:15 – The key: Answer quickly, concisely, and move on\n• 00:07:40 – Why “Why didn’t you finish college?” is a trick question designed to test you\n• 00:08:39 – How to frame your answer: Acknowledge, pivot, and show how you’ve moved forward\n• 00:09:54 – Ethan’s personal example: Why he left his PhD program and how he explains it in interviews\n\n Key Takeaways:\n\n✔ Interviews are a skill you must practice—they determine your career opportunities\n✔ Prepare in advance for tough questions—don’t get caught off guard\n✔ Silence is awkward in interviews—have quick, structured responses\n✔ Be honest, but strategic—frame your answers in a positive way\n✔ Acknowledge weaknesses, pivot to strengths, and keep the conversation moving\n📌 About Ethan Evans\nEthan Evans is a leadership and career coach with deep expertise in hiring, interviewing, and career growth. His practical insights help professionals level up their careers and land their dream jobs.\n\n🔗 More Resources\n🔹 Connect with Ethan Evans on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/\n🔹 Explore Ethan Evans website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n🔹 Check out leadership & career development courses: https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
