    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "plum",
    "description": "Ever dreamed of leading teams at a company like Amazon? \n\nLearn how Ethan Evans went from a dinosaur-obsessed kid to Amazon VP, survived career disasters, and rebuilt trust with Jeff Bezos himself. Discover actionable strategies for leadership growth, handling toxic bosses, and why emotional intelligence beats IQ every time.\n\n👇 TIMESTAMPS & KEY TOPICS 👇\n\n01:00 - Where it all started: From dinosaurs to Amazon VP \n\n02:45 - Successful Leaders: People Element in Leadership\n\n04:35 -  Path to Leadership: What skills are needed for leadership \n\n07:10 - Handling Difficult Situations: Being young and managing others\n\n\n11:00 - Solving Problems when things go wrong\n\n\n13:40 - Rebuilding Trust with Jeff Bezos and Getting Promoted\n\n\n15:10 - Managing Up: Pushback from younger employees\n\n\n19:20 - What to do when you have a Toxic Boss\n\n Actionable Tips\n\nFix Feedback Failures: Instead of “Here’s what you did wrong,” ask: “Can I share areas you might want to rethink?”\n\nSurviving Toxic Bosses: Separate self-worth from work. Plan your escape while “digging tunnels” at night.\n\nPromotion Hack: Track impact (projects shipped) not hours worked. Build trust via ownership, not perfection.\n\nCTA (Call-to-Action)\n\n🔔 Subscribe for leadership hacks: [Your Channel Link]\n📥 Free Resource: “10 Phrases to Fix Toxic Work Relationships” [Link in Description]\n💬 Comment: “DIGGING” if you’ve survived a nightmare boss!\n\n\n#careergrowth #leadership #amazon #toxicboss #workplaceadvice #management #emotionalintelligence #careeradvice #promotion #trust\n\nThis episode is a set of highlights from Ethan’s appearance on the Learn it All podcast. \n\nYou can watch the full episode here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vYkM9aBUwrs",
