    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WZzRq-m_l1w",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "plum",
    "description": "Why I Left Amazon as a VP & How I Built a $700K Business Working 20 Hours a Week\n\nIn this conversation with @PeterYangYT we discuss my career transition from Amazon VP to entrepreneur, how to build financial freedom, and why networking and sharing your passions online is the key to career longevity.\n\nWhat you'll learn:\n\n✅ The reality of corporate leadership vs. entrepreneurship\n✅ How to build a business that pays $700K+ per year with only 20 hours of work\n✅ Key growth levers for scaling a successful online business\n✅ The importance of building a personal network before you need it\n\n🔹 Timestamps & Key Highlights\n\n00:00 Introduction – A Career Reflection\n\nFrom Amazon VP to entrepreneur—comparing two career paths\n\nMaking $700K a year working 20 hours a week\n\nWhy financial freedom lets you choose impact over obligations\n\n01:11 Why Entrepreneurship Is More Fulfilling Than Corporate Life\n\n02:45 Work vs. Meaning – Why Just Retiring Isn’t Enough\n\n03:32 How I Grew to $700K in Three Years\n\n05:45 How to Future-Proof Your Career\n\n\nWhy layoffs happen, and how to avoid being career-vulnerable\nYou don’t need to be an Amazon VP to build career options\nThe importance of building your network NOW, not when you need it\n\n06:55 The #1 Career Growth Advice: Build a Personal Network\n\nHow sharing your passion online attracts like-minded people\nTwitch, LinkedIn, niche communities—you already have an audience\nWhy people who engage in communities always have opportunities\n\n07:49 Why You Need to Start NOW\n\n08:59 Wishes vs. Action – Why Most People Stay Stagnant\n\nKey Takeaways\n\nYour career should serve your life, not the other way around\nStart building your network before you need it\nPassion + consistency = financial & career freedom\n\nTake action today—the best time to start was yesterday\n\n💬 What resonated most with you? Drop a comment below!\n👍 If you enjoyed this, hit LIKE & SUBSCRIBE for more career & leadership insights!\n📢 Share this with a friend who needs to hear it!\n\n🔗 More Resources\n\n🔹 Connect with Ethan Evans on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/\n🔹 Explore Ethan Evans website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n🔹 Check out leadership & career development courses: https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
