    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "plum",
    "description": "In this conversation with @PeterYangYT , Ethan breaks down The Magic Loop framework, a simple yet powerful five-step system to accelerate your career growth, gain your manager’s trust, and transition into higher leadership roles. We also dive into risk-taking, strategic thinking, and building trust in the workplace—even after making mistakes.\n\nThe full discussion is available @PeterYangYT . \n\n🎯 What you’ll learn:\n\n✔️ The Magic Loop framework for career growth\n✔️ How to ask for opportunities and avoid being overlooked\n✔️ When to take risks and make bold career moves\n✔️ How to build trust with leaders (even after a failure)\n✔️ Why strategic thinking and self-promotion matter in career advancement\n\n🔹 Timestamps & Key Highlights\n\n📌 00:00 – What is the Magic Loop?\n📌 02:44 – Where Do People Get Stuck?\n📌 04:06 – How to Offload Low-Value Work\n📌 04:58 – Leadership & Decision-Making: How Much Should You Dive Deep?\n📌 07:09 – Developing Your Team: How to Encourage Growth\n📌 09:36 – How to Ask for a Career Change When Your Manager Doesn’t Want You to Leave\n📌 12:51 – How to Build a Strong Relationship with Your Manager\n📌 13:55 – Why Emotional Intelligence Matters More Than Technical Skills\n📌 15:37 – Building Trust at Work: What It Really Means\n📌 20:19 – How Bold Decisions Lead to Promotions\n📌 22:39 – How Companies Succeed by Surviving Long Enough\n📌 27:41 – How to Rebuild Trust After a Major Failure\n📌 32:26 – The Importance of Ownership & Visibility\n\nKey Takeaways\n\nThe Magic Loop helps you get promoted and grow faster\nVisibility, self-promotion, and risk-taking matter more than people think\nTrust is built through reliability, ownership, and how you handle failures\nGreat leaders develop their teams—and smart employees learn how to stand out\n\nSometimes success is just about staying in the game long enough.\n\n💬 What’s your biggest takeaway from this episode? Drop a comment below!\n👍 Enjoyed this? Like & Subscribe for more career insights!\n📢 Share this video with a friend who wants to level up their career!\n\n🔗 More Resources\n🔹 Connect with Ethan Evans on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/\n🔹 Explore Ethan Evans website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n🔹 Check out leadership & career development courses: https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)\n\n#career #promotion #executive",
