    "format": "Masterclass",
    "sourceLabel": "Auto-discovered",
    "sourceNote": "Auto-discovered from Ethan’s public YouTube channel with YouTube Data API; review before publishing.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-BAdkBGjOIlccGLZ3jbLiA",
    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=is93w_nTxLU",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "teal",
    "description": "In this Level Up Workshop, Alan O'Beirne (Senior GenAI PM at Amazon) gives a 101 breakdown on why it's critical to use AI in your work now and provides specific prompt examples/phrases to use to get the most out of AI tools. \n\n- The 101 breakdown / mental models section until 00:23:14\n- The prompting examples/phrases section starts at 00:24:06\n\nThis talk is relevant to you if:\n1/ You are an AI beginner\n2/ You are afraid or unsure how to think about and use AI\n3/ You want a list of exact prompt phrases to use for tools like ChatGPT\n\nThis talk is NOT relevant to you if:\n1/ You are a heavy AI user already\n2/ You know how to get a lot from tools like ChatGPT\n\n---\nAbout Alan O'Beirne:\n​Alan is a Senior GenAI Program Manager at Amazon where he builds, launches and enables internal GenAI tools and initiatives globally. Prior to this, he spent 7 years in recruitment at Amazon Web Services (AWS) where he was promoted 3 times and had a team of 80+ reporting to him in 10 countries. He also has two failed tech startups which he launched on the side.\n\n​Connect with Alan on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/awsaob/\n\n---\nAbout Level Up\n​​​Level Up is your source for executive insights, high performance habits, and specific career growth actions\n\nJoin here: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/subscribe\n\nExplore Ethan's website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n\nEthan's leadership development courses https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
