    "topicLabel": "Career Growth & Promotion",
    "tags": [],
    "format": "Conversation",
    "sourceLabel": "Auto-discovered",
    "sourceNote": "Auto-discovered from Ethan’s public YouTube channel with YouTube Data API; review before publishing.",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-BAdkBGjOIlccGLZ3jbLiA",
    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ijM7ZcCMWk0",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "orange",
    "description": "Chaitali Narla (​former Google & Stripe executive) and Jason Yoong (COO at Level Up) discuss the biggest challenges women in tech often face in their careers and personal lives and what it takes for rapid career growth (something Chaitali knows deeply as she went from Google intern to Director — 5 promotions — in a decade). \n\nResources referenced by Chaitali:\nCarla Harris on sponsorship - https://youtu.be/gpE_W50OTUc?feature=shared\nTanya Reilly on glue work - https://youtu.be/KClAPipnKqw?feature=shared\nDan Na on pushing through friction - https://youtu.be/8bxZuzDKoI0?feature=shared\n\nChaitali's articles:\nWork life tapestry - https://www.chaitime.chaitalinarla.com/p/work-life-tapestry\n\n3 Career Principles that got me to Director at Google - https://www.chaitime.chaitalinarla.com/cp/151502881\n \nSide Quests That Supercharged A Tech Executive’s Career - https://www.chaitime.chaitalinarla.com/cp/151120357\n\n---------\nAbout Chaitali Narla\n​Chaitali is a tech executive and career coach with 15+ years of experience in multiple domains including SaaS, Cloud, Mobile and AI. She grew her career from internship to directorship in the first decade of her career. She is an avid reader and podcast listener. She is also a mom to 9yo Saanvi and balances her demanding tech job with motherhood and family.\n\n​She is a former Eng Lead at Stripe and ex-Google Director.\n\n​In ChaiTime (highly recommended), Chaitali writes about lessons learned from her accelerated career journey. She shares stories about how she juggles the various aspects of her personal and professional life. She also connects her reading/watching to practical career advice.\n\nSubscribe to her newsletter: https://www.chaitime.chaitalinarla.com/\n\nConnect with Chaitali on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/chaitalinarla/\n\n---------\nAbout Jason Yoong\nJason has run multiple $1B+ businesses across eCommerce, marketplaces, advertising, and media. He's led 40+ person organizations, owned department P&L, managed $400M+ marketing budgets for Fortune 100 entertainment (movies and TV) and consumer electronics clients, and served as an Advisory Board Member.\n\nAfter leading and building at publicly traded companies Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG), Jason joined the founding team of a venture-backed software startup and raised $8M seed.\n\nJason is now building Level Up: Your source for executive insights, high performance habits, and specific career growth actions with Ethan Evans (retired Amazon Vice President). He also serves on the Harvard Business Review advisory council and as a mentor at First Round Capital and Techstars.\n\nConnect with Jason on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\n---------\nAbout Level Up\n​​​Level Up is your source for executive insights, high performance habits, and specific career growth actions\n\nJoin here: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/subscribe\n\nExplore Ethan's website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n\nEthan's leadership development courses https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
    "published": "2025-02-02T00:04:37.000Z"
