    "description": "Retired Amazon VP and Executive Coach Ethan Evans teaches you the difference between mentors, coaches, and sponsors, and tells you when to look for each in your career.\n\nThen, Ethan gives you his personal tips for approaching mentors and getting buy-in from busy leaders. Getting guidance from an experienced mentor is one of the key ways to advance in your career, but it requires a structured approach. You need to find mentors who will put you up for opportunities and support your growth throughout certain stages of your career. \n\nCoaches will help you navigate specific problems, and our normally different from your mentors. \n\nEthan Evans shares tips and examples from his experience and also answers common questions about mentorship, coaching, and sponsorship. Tune in to hear how some of his tips and insights can help your career development.\n\n#EthanEvans #Leadership #Executive #career #careeradvice #mentor \n\nCheck out our website: https://ethanevansvp.com\nFollow Ethan on social media: \nTwitter -    https://x.com/EthanEvansVP\nLinkedIn -   https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/",
