    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x6vvkQ52jvc",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "amber",
    "description": "Justin Best (​two time Olympian, Olympic Gold Medalist at the Paris 2024 Olympics in men's four rowing, and Analyst at Union Square Advisors) and Jason Yoong (COO at Level Up) discuss peak performance as an Olympic champion and investment banker.\n\nWe unpack how Justin excels with his INTENSE training and work schedule, sleep optimization techniques, ways to drive sustained motivation, breaking down big goals, sacrifice, career advice, and favorite Olympic memories. \n\nWhen I (Jason) first read about Justin's work/training schedule...I immediately forwarded it to a few folks saying \"this guy is a BEAST.\"\n\n---------\nTopics discussed:\n00:00 Introduction\n00:30 Justin's Daily Routine for Peak Performance\n02:21 Balancing Sleep and Caffeine\n03:53 Tips for Quality Sleep\n05:40 Finding Motivation and Setting Goals\n09:27 Journey to Becoming an Olympic Champion\n14:29 Balancing Work and Training\n20:35 Effective Goal Setting and Overcoming Setbacks\n25:04 Hyper-Competitive Nature\n26:05 Recovery Techniques and Tips\n32:46 Mentorship and Career Advice\n34:37 Olympic Memories and Reflections\n37:03 Dealing with Stress and Challenges\n38:58 Future Goals and Finding Meaning\n46:50 Final Thoughts\n\n---------\nAbout Justin Best\n​Justin is a two time Olympian and Olympic Gold Medalist at the Paris 2024 Olympics in the men’s 4 rowing event. He's also an Analyst at Union Square Advisors.\n\n​\"Competition is the mechanism that helps more productive companies expand and take market share...\" — William W. Lewis. This quote is pulled from The Power of Productivity, a publication from the McKinsey Quarterly and I (Justin) have never really found a statement that can perfectly describe my attitude towards business better.\n\n​​Connect with Justin on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/justinbest30/\n\n​Learn more about USRowing: https://usrowing.org/\n\nLearn more about Team USA: https://www.teamusa.com/\n\n---------\nAbout Jason Yoong\nJason has run multiple $1B+ businesses across eCommerce, marketplaces, advertising, and media. He's led 40+ person organizations, owned department P&L, managed $400M+ marketing budgets for Fortune 100 entertainment (movies and TV) and consumer electronics clients, and served as an Advisory Board Member.\n\nAfter leading and building at publicly traded companies Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG), Jason joined the founding team of a venture-backed software startup and raised $8M seed.\n\nJason is now building Level Up: Your source for executive insights, high performance habits, and specific career growth actions with Ethan Evans (retired Amazon Vice President). He also serves on the Harvard Business Review advisory council and as a mentor at First Round Capital and Techstars.\n\nConnect with Jason on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\n---------\nAbout Level Up\n​​​Level Up is your source for executive insights, high performance habits, and specific career growth actions\n\nJoin here: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/subscribe\n\nExplore Ethan's website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n\nEthan's leadership development courses https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
