    "watchUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wjxfssi5B6w",
    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "blue",
    "description": "FREE LIVE TRAINING on June 27 (9AM PT) - Executive Presence: How to communicate with authority and get noticed at the highest levels. Register here: https://www.ethanevans.com/wb-lpo-ep\n\nRetired Executives Ethan Evans (Amazon) and David Markley (Warner Brothers Discovery) discuss how employees can approach talking to their executives in order to create strong, productive relationships. \n\nExcerpt from a live Twitch Stream in April, 2020. Full stream available here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z3_rJj7HL2A \n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe vast majority of successful professionals are not executives today. Many do not wish to be, or are not sure if they want to be. Some of you, however, do want to become executives. Others are curious to know what it takes to be an executive leader.\n\nMany people can benefit from at least understanding how executives get their roles and then succeed at them. After all, unless you run your own company (in which case, you are the Chief EXECUTIVE Officer), you probably ultimately work for an executive. Understanding that person and their role will likely help you succeed - may even help you stand out.\n\nEthan Evans and David Markley reflect on their experiences and how their approach to work, their actions and business decisions brought them to their current executive leadership roles, and what they do today as leaders in highly visible roles.  Tune in to hear how some of their tips and insights can help you speed-run your own career and development.\n\n#EthanEvans #Leadership #DavidMarkley #PathToLeadershipRole #Executive\n\nCheck out our website: https://ethanevansvp.com\nFollow Ethan on social media: \nTwitter -    https://x.com/EthanEvansVP\nLinkedIn -   https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/",
