    "accent": "green",
    "description": "Ethan Evans is a former Vice President at Amazon, where he spent over 15 years driving innovation and working directly with Jeff Bezos. During his tenure, Ethan led global teams of over 800 people and helped create groundbreaking products like Prime Video, Prime Gaming, and Twitch Commerce. He has conducted over 2,500 interviews, co-developed one of Amazon’s leadership principles, and holds more than 70 patents. Ethan has even interviewed with Elon Musk and gained firsthand insights into leadership at the highest level. \n\nIn this episode, we dive into topics such as: \n•Dealing with demanding managers\n•How to unstuck your career \n•How to get Ethan as a mentor to help you get ahead in your career\n•Handling complex projects like Prime Video \n•Surviving layoffs\n\nWatch Part 1 at Raj's Channel: https://youtu.be/cgh4ZnhkpQQ\n\nJoin Ethan's Career Community: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/level-up-career-community\n\n **Connect with Raj**\n📰 Sign up for my FREE newsletter: https://cloudwithraj.com/newsletter \n🏢 LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/cloudwithraj/\n🤳 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/cloudwithraj/ \n\nTimestamps: \n00:00 Who is Raj Saha and Ethan Evans? \n01:13 How to deal with demanding managers\n05:07 How to unstuck your career \n09:55 Get Ethan as YOUR mentor, starting Prime Video\n18:16 Surviving layoffs\n\n #amazon #ethanevans #cloudwithraj",
