    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "amber",
    "description": "Level Up Newsletter & Community paid members were invited to join this live event with Wes Kao (Cofounder of Maven & altMBA) and Jason Yoong discussing the art of managing up.\n\nWes emphasizes the importance of proactive communication, understanding manager's needs through observation, the iterative process of aligning with senior leaders, actionable tactics to build trust with managers, enhancing the perceived value of non-glamorous projects, gracefully navigating the dynamics with intense or insecure bosses, and how to stay connected with influential mentors. \n\n---------\nTopics discussed:\n00:00 Introduction\n00:49 Diving into Managing Up\n02:25 The Virtuous Cycle of Managing Up\n05:38 Observing and Understanding Your Manager\n11:01 Building Rapport with a New Boss\n13:30 Handling Low-Priority Projects\n18:02 Engaging with Senior Executives\n27:33 Building Trust and Avoiding Surprises\n28:43 Reducing Cognitive Load for Managers\n29:55 Effective Problem-Solving Communication\n36:03 The Importance of High Standards\n39:26 Navigating Feedback and Manager Relationships\n41:53 Handling Unreasonable Expectations\n50:33 Managing Up with Insecure Managers\n53:07 Maintaining Professional Relationships\n55:14 Final Thoughts\n\n---------\nAbout Wes Kao\n​​Wes is an entrepreneur, speaker, coach, and advisor. A few highlights:\n\n​-- Co-founded Maven, a platform for live online courses. Raised $25M from First Round & Andreessen Horowitz.\n\n​-- Co-founded the altMBA with bestselling author Seth Godin.\n\n​-- Advised CEOs of Section (Professor Scott Galloway), Outlier (co-founder of Masterclass), and Morning Brew on go-to-market, positioning, and growth.\n\n​Now Wes works with founders and senior leaders via 1:1 executive coaching, typically in areas like setting a high bar of excellence, leveling up your strategic communication, and managing lean teams with ambitious goals.\n\n​Wes writes a newsletter read by 40,000+ high-performing leaders, operators, and marketers, and teaches a course on Maven.\n\n​Follow Wes on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/weskao/\nSubscribe to Wes' newsletter: https://newsletter.weskao.com/\nWes' Maven course (inaugural cohort sold out in 24 hrs): https://maven.com/wes-kao/executive-communication-influence\nBook Wes for 1:1 coaching: https://www.weskao.com/coaching\n\n---------\nAbout Level Up\n​​​Level Up is your source for career growth solutions & community by retired Amazon Vice President, Ethan Evans.\n\nPaid newsletter subscribers get: Every issue of the newsletter (~8 per month); Access to a private Slack community with networking events; and Access to member-only content such as Ethan’s Career Talk classes (includes live attendance with Q&A), watch Ethan live coach a real client, fireside chats with leaders, and more.\n\nTo become a subscriber, join here: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/level-up-career-community\n\nJason Yoong is the operating partner at Level Up (and ex-Amazon).\n\nConnect with Jason on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasonyoong/\n\nExplore Ethan's website: https://www.ethanevans.com/\n\nEthan's leadership development courses https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)",
