    "duration": "Watch on YouTube",
    "accent": "plum",
    "description": "Level Up Newsletter & Community paid members were invited to join this live discussion with Ethan Evans & Peter Mueller (Co-Founding Partner at Breakwater Ventures) discussing \"Early Stage Startup Investing\".\n\n​​Topics discussed:\n00:00 Introduction and Guest Welcome\n01:03 Peter Mueller's Career Journey\n03:51 Breakwater Ventures Overview\n04:33 Investment Thesis and Regional Focus\n13:08 AI Hype and Investment Trends\n22:28 Advice for Aspiring Founders\n28:00 Understanding VC Pitch Ratios\n28:45 The Importance of Warm Intros\n29:33 Building Connections in the Venture World\n31:06 The Value of Reputation in VC\n33:29 Horror Stories from VC Pitches\n35:12 Opportunities for Niche Startups\n38:15 Deals That Got Away\n42:40 Defining Venture Scale Startups\n47:00 Navigating VC Follow-Ups\n49:03 Collaborative Investments and Fund Sizes\n54:56 Concluding Thoughts and Farewell\n\n---------\n​Backstory: Ethan and Peter\n​​It started with Peter commenting on Ethan's Twitch streams and then turned into \"Twitch Tank\" (Shark Tank style show for Twitch) where contestants presented ideas to Ethan, Peter, and Devin Nash to get live feedback.\n\n---------\n​About Peter Mueller\n​Peter is the Co-Founding Partner at Breakwater Ventures, a pre-seed and seed fund that invests in exceptional founding teams across the US and Canada with a preference for founding teams in the Pacific Northwest and Western Canada.\n\n​Before starting Breakwater, Peter was a Partner at SeaChange Fund, an early employee at Carta, an Equity Research Analyst covering TMT at Merrill Lynch, and worked at several private equity firms. \n\n​​Follow Peter on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/pjsmuelller/\n\n---------\nLive attendance at this event was exclusive to Level Up Career Community members.\n\nLevel Up is your source for career growth solutions & community:\n(A) Free members get 4 full newsletter articles a month.\n\n(B) Paid members get 8 articles + exclusive access to ongoing live podcasts/events (e.g. career talks, watching live executive coaching with a real client, fireside chats w/leaders, career Q&A) + all video recordings (23+ hours to date) + a private Slack community for leadership networking.\n\nRead about membership benefits, testimonials, video highlights, and join here: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/level-up-career-community\n\n---------\nAbout Ethan Evans:\nIn Ethan's 15+ years at Amazon, he led global teams of 800+ and invented well-known businesses and products such as Prime Video, Amazon Video, Amazon Appstore, Merch by Amazon, Prime Gaming (formerly Twitch Prime), and Twitch Commerce. \n\n-- 70+ patents. \n-- Reviewed 10,000+ resumes, conducted 2,500+ interviews, and 1,000+ hires. \n-- Was an Amazon Bar Raiser and Bar Raiser Core Leader, responsible for training and maintaining Amazon's group of interview outcome facilitators. \n-- Helped advocate for and draft the Amazon Leadership Principle (LP) “Ownership” — the words, “They never say ‘that’s not my job.’” are Ethan's. \n\nEthan's LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/ethanevansvp/\n\nEthan's leadership development courses https://maven.com/ethan-evans (live online) and https://ethan-evans.mykajabi.com/ (on-demand)\n\nBecome a Level Up member: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/level-up-career-community",
