    "accent": "orange",
    "description": "Level Up Newsletter & Community paid members were invited to join this live discussion and Q&A with Irina Stanescu and Jason Yoong on \"How to Influence Without Authority\".\n\n---------\nAbout Irina Stanescu:\n​Irina is an engineering leader, leadership coach, and LinkedIn Top Voice. She was a tech lead manager at Google and a staff software engineer at Uber.\n\n​At Google, Irina's team built dynamic ad insertion in the linear and on-demand TV streams for the Google Fiber Mobile TV App. The project involved multiple orgs: Google Fiber, YouTube and DoubleClick, and Irina successfully influenced across all 3 organizations.\n\n​At Uber, Irina’s team was in charge of the entire Eater Delivery Experience in the Uber Eats Eater app, which was a place of intersection for multiple other teams and functions.\n\nSubscribe to Irina's newsletter “The Caring Techie”: https://www.thecaringtechie.com/\n\nLearn about Irina's Maven live online class (rated 4.8/5) \"Impact through Influence - Influence Without Authority In Engineering Teams\": https://maven.com/irina-stanescu/influence-swe\n\n​​Follow Irina on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/irinastanescu/\n\n---------\nAbout Jason Yoong:\nJason has run multiple $1B+ businesses across eCommerce, marketplaces, advertising, and media. He's led 40+ person organizations, owned department P&L, managed $400M+ marketing budgets for Fortune 100 entertainment (movies and broadcast TV) and consumer electronics clients, and served as a non-profit Advisory Board Member.\n\nAfter leading and building at publicly traded companies Amazon, Dentsu Aegis, and Universal McCann (IPG), Jason joined the founding team of a venture-backed software startup and raised $8M seed.\n\nJason is now building Level Up: Your source for career growth solutions and community with Ethan Evans (retired Amazon Vice President) and serves as a mentor at First Round Capital and Techstars.\n\nBecome a Level Up member: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/level-up-career-community\n\n---------\nLive attendance at this event was exclusive to Level Up Career Community members.\n\nLevel Up is your source for career growth solutions & community:\n(A) Free members get 4 full newsletter articles a month.\n\n(B) Paid members get 8 articles + exclusive access to ongoing live podcasts/events (e.g. career talks, watching live executive coaching with a real client, fireside chats w/leaders, career Q&A) + all video recordings (16+ hours to date) + a private Slack community for leadership networking.\n\nRead about membership benefits, testimonials, video highlights, and join here: https://levelupwithethanevans.substack.com/p/level-up-career-community",
